  "script": "simplified",
  "durationMs": 81163,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "seg-0001",
      "index": 0,
      "startMs": 300,
      "endMs": 4287,
      "text": "哎，你最近是不是在搞个什么 app？朋友圈老看你发。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0002",
      "index": 1,
      "startMs": 4737,
      "endMs": 11165,
      "text": "对！叫 Pebble，是一个中文学习工具，专门把播客转录并翻译成英文。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0003",
      "index": 2,
      "startMs": 11615,
      "endMs": 14387,
      "text": "有点东西啊。你怎么突然想做这个？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0004",
      "index": 3,
      "startMs": 14837,
      "endMs": 24461,
      "text": "其实就是解决我自己的痛点。我平时在小宇宙上听播客学中文，但 app 里根本没有翻译功能，根本学不了。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0005",
      "index": 4,
      "startMs": 24911,
      "endMs": 29202,
      "text": "懂，那卡点确实挺窒息的。那你现在中文什么水平？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0006",
      "index": 5,
      "startMs": 29652,
      "endMs": 39674,
      "text": "我目前在准备 HSK 5，想通过大量的输入来学，比如播客。但听不懂的地方，没法查，没法记，干着急。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0007",
      "index": 6,
      "startMs": 40124,
      "endMs": 42211,
      "text": "所以你就干脆自己做了一个？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0008",
      "index": 7,
      "startMs": 42661,
      "endMs": 50216,
      "text": "对，一开始就是自用。做设计的人嘛，遇到问题第一反应就是——那我来设计个解决方案。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0009",
      "index": 8,
      "startMs": 50666,
      "endMs": 55133,
      "text": "绝了，这就是吃自己的狗粮啊。那 Pebble 具体能干啥？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0010",
      "index": 9,
      "startMs": 55583,
      "endMs": 63405,
      "text": "它可以转录你自己的播客音频，逐句翻译成英文，还能对照着看。这样我就能一边听一边学。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0011",
      "index": 10,
      "startMs": 63855,
      "endMs": 67104,
      "text": "听起来很实用。所以你的 mission 是啥？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0012",
      "index": 11,
      "startMs": 67554,
      "endMs": 75001,
      "text": "就是让学中文的人，能直接从真实的播客内容里学。原汁原味的语料，比课本香多了。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0013",
      "index": 12,
      "startMs": 75451,
      "endMs": 77780,
      "text": "可以可以，那这个必须给我安排一个。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0014",
      "index": 13,
      "startMs": 78230,
      "endMs": 80563,
      "text": "哈哈，蹲着吧，等我上线。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    }
  ],
